ll-text describe GPT-4 as a large-scale multimodal Transformer pre-trained to predict the next token, which is a genuine generative foundation model. The title suggests a different bio-focused topic, creating mixed signals in the record.","evidence_snippet":"\"Transformerbased model pre-trained to predict the next token in a document\"; \"large-scale, multimodal model\""},"python_gate":{"provisional_decision":"ADJUDICATE","provisional_code":"EC1_no_bio_modality","adjudication_reason":"criterion_unclear_or_reviewer_conflict","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","bio_modality_present":"no","text_component_present":"yes","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","generative_model_present":"yes","foundation_model_evidence":"yes"}}}]

